"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"OINbC0rpDVJ5bfxt3LO9fw","review_id":"ZCo3clcu4BZvKvmoS8kn9A","date":"2018-07-02T20:59:08","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9389759302139282,"text_excerpt":"I was staying in French Quarter and on my last day, i asked the concierge what to eat for my last meal. Of all the restaurants he recommended upscale restaurants but we were looking for something more low key. He recommended lil dizzy's and said of all of the recommendations, go to lil dizzy's. They have an all you can eat buffet of GOOD soul food for $15! It includes baked chicken, fried chicken, seafood gumbo, rice, red beans, Mac and cheese and bread pudding! Oh my gosh all of was so good! It's a local joint so that's how you know it's good. The fried chicken is the best fried chicken I've ever had. The seafood gumbo is more on the watery side, not thick like other gumbo i have had. Bu..."},{"business_id":"OINbC0rpDVJ5bfxt3LO9fw","review_id":"88fzM3pEmkhfnkQh8AGg7w","date":"2017-04-16T23:12:48","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9363001585006714,"text_excerpt":"Located a short Uber drive from the Quarter, we discovered this place from yelp...and so glad we did. We came for lunch and got the buffet. The fried chicken was the best I ever had...each was cooked perfectly. Each of the other dishes were very very good as well...a nice mix of some creole and Cajun foods. Atmosphere is laid back/casual with lots of locals...who know where to go for great food."},{"business_id":"OINbC0rpDVJ5bfxt3LO9fw","review_id":"6LBdwIYqLDMqRtSbecgH_w","date":"2019-11-24T21:22:02","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9361710548400879,"text_excerpt":"This is one of those spots that you've got to visit when you are in NOLA. The Baquet family has owned spots around NOLA since the 40's based on the restaurants web site. I remember Eddie's back in the 80's, and Zachary's in the 90's. Happy that the tradition continues w/ Lil Dizzy's. I've visited before, but never left a review. Stopped in earlier this month for the lunch buffet on a Monday afternoon. Parking can be tight in the area, but we didn't have too much difficulty finding a spot on the street. The 3rd member of our party was running late and we were told that we would have to wait. After 5min, the went ahead and seated us anyway. Briefly spoke w/ Mr. Baquet while waiting to remin..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"OINbC0rpDVJ5bfxt3LO9fw","photo_id":"eNO2kq9jjwBNEjYRdbrAgQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/eNO2kq9jjwBNEjYRdbrAgQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.860554575920105},{"business_id":"OINbC0rpDVJ5bfxt3LO9fw","photo_id":"5W10y34Hkq5NQlBuQ7ri2w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/5W10y34Hkq5NQlBuQ7ri2w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8516422510147095},{"business_id":"OINbC0rpDVJ5bfxt3LO9fw","photo_id":"C61Q5ovRv18yRI6jHQkHHQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/C61Q5ovRv18yRI6jHQkHHQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8299344778060913},{"business_id":"OINbC0rpDVJ5bfxt3LO9fw","photo_id":"LIp_dJYO26JcI61ENFgVpg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/LIp_dJYO26JcI61ENFgVpg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8212356567382812},{"business_id":"OINbC0rpDVJ5bfxt3LO9fw","photo_id":"LkgbuuLk9Ba5BSPZZ_W-5w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/LkgbuuLk9Ba5BSPZZ_W-5w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8148866891860962}]},"notebook_case":null}
